{{#if libraryError}}<p role="alert">Biblioteca indisponível. <button type="button" data-action="retry">Tentar novamente</button></p>{{/if}}
<div class="npc-generator-body npc-build-v2">
 <details class="npc-generator-controls" data-view-key="identity" open><summary>Identidade <small>NC {{draft.nc}} · {{summaryStyle}} · {{summaryOrigin}}</small></summary>
  <label>Nome<input data-field="name" value="{{draft.name}}" maxlength="100" placeholder="Nome do NPC"></label>
  <div class="npc-generator-options">
   <label>Tipo<select data-field="role">{{#each roles}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label>NC<input type="number" data-field="nc" min="4" max="20" step="1" value="{{draft.nc}}"></label>
   <label>Estilo<select data-field="style">{{#each styles}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label>Foco<select data-field="focus">{{#each focuses}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label>Vila<select data-field="village">{{#each villages}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label class="npc-build-origin">Clã / Kekkei Genkai / Hijutsu<select data-field="origin"><option value="">Sem origem especial</option>{{#each origins}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label>Tamanho<select data-field="size">{{#each sizes}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label class="npc-build-element">Elemento<select data-field="element">{{#each elements}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
   <label class="npc-build-element">Segundo elemento (opcional)<select data-field="secondElement" title="Normalmente exige Espírito 10. Exceções de clã e hijutsu seguem suas próprias regras.">{{#each secondElements}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
  </div>
  <div class="npc-generator-toggles"><label><input type="checkbox" data-field="foreignOrigin" {{#if draft.foreignOrigin}}checked{{/if}}> Permitir origem de outra vila</label>{{#if isMinion}}<label><input type="checkbox" data-field="reinforcedDefense" {{#if draft.reinforcedDefense}}checked{{/if}}> Defesa +2</label>{{/if}}</div>
  {{#if isUchiha}}<label class="npc-build-event"><input type="checkbox" data-trauma {{#if draft.events.mangekyouTrauma}}checked{{/if}}> O NPC viveu o evento traumático necessário ao Mangekyou.</label>{{/if}}
  {{#if isSummoner}}<label>Contrato<select data-field="summonSpecies">{{#each species}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label class="npc-build-event"><input type="checkbox" data-field="createCompanion" {{#if draft.createCompanion}}checked{{/if}}> Criar a ficha da invocação vinculada</label>{{/if}}
  {{#if isJiongu}}<fieldset class="npc-special-options"><legend>Corações de Jiongu</legend><p>O primeiro coração é seu. Preencha os demais somente quando o NPC já os tiver obtido.</p><div class="npc-generator-options">{{#each hearts}}<label>{{label}}<select data-heart="{{index}}" {{#if disabled}}disabled{{/if}}>{{#each options}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/each}}</div></fieldset>{{/if}}
  {{#if isFalseBijuu}}<label>Caudas da bijuu<input type="number" data-field="falseBijuuTails" value="{{draft.falseBijuuTails}}" min="1" max="9"></label>{{/if}}
  {{#if isDrawing}}<label>Desenhos por invocação<input type="number" data-field="drawingsCount" value="{{draft.drawingsCount}}" min="1" max="2"></label>{{/if}}
 </details>
 <main class="npc-generator-preview">
  {{#if error}}<p class="npc-generator-error" role="alert">{{error}} Corrija as escolhas para atualizar a prévia.</p>{{/if}}
  <header class="npc-generator-section"><h3>Prévia da ficha</h3><button type="button" data-action="reset"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> Compras automáticas</button></header>
  {{#if preview}}
  <div class="npc-build-budget"><span><strong>{{preview.budget.spent}} / {{preview.budgetMax}}</strong> PP</span><span><strong>{{preview.budget.freeUsed}} / 3</strong> aptidões gratuitas</span><span><strong>{{preview.skillSpent}} / {{preview.skillMax}}</strong> pontos de perícia</span></div>
  <div class="npc-generator-attributes">{{#each attributes}}<div><small>{{label}}</small><strong>{{value}}</strong></div>{{/each}}</div>
  <div class="npc-generator-stats">{{#each stats}}<div>{{label}} <strong>{{value}}</strong></div>{{/each}}</div>
  <div class="npc-build-budget"><span>Vitalidade <strong>{{preview.vitality}}</strong></span><span>Chakra <strong>{{preview.chakra}}</strong></span><span>Defesa fixa <strong>{{preview.fixedDefense}}</strong></span></div>
  {{#if isMinion}}<p class="npc-generator-hint">Capanga: 1 de Vitalidade; sem crítico, golpe de misericórdia ou ataque oportuno contra outros tipos de personagem. Testes de Atributo/Perícia falham, salvo exceção expressa. Básico, p.281.</p>{{/if}}
  <header class="npc-generator-section"><h3>Técnicas</h3><button type="button" data-action="shuffle"><i class="fa-solid fa-dice"></i> Sortear efeitos</button></header>
  <details class="npc-build-effects" data-view-key="effect-choices"><summary>Escolher efeitos por nível</summary>{{#each preview.effectRows}}<label>{{powerName}} · {{slot}}<select data-effect="{{powerId}}" data-slot="{{slot}}">{{#each options}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/each}}</details>
  <div class="npc-generator-techniques">{{#each preview.choices}}<article><label><input type="checkbox" data-technique="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}} {{#if locked}}disabled{{/if}}><img src="{{img}}" alt=""><strong>{{name}}</strong></label><details data-view-key="description|{{id}}"><summary>Descrição</summary><div class="npc-generator-description" data-lazy-description="{{id}}"></div></details></article>{{/each}}</div>
  {{#each preview.notices}}<p class="npc-generator-hint"><strong>{{name}}</strong>: {{reason}}</p>{{/each}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if abilityRows}}<header class="npc-generator-section"><h3>Habilidades da origem</h3></header><p class="npc-generator-hint">As compras marcadas ajustam atributos e dependências. O nível máximo dos poderes é metade do NC.</p>
  <div class="npc-build-purchases">{{#each abilityRows}}<article data-purchase="{{id}}"><div class="npc-build-purchase-line"><label><input type="checkbox" data-purchase-check {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}><strong>{{name}}</strong></label>{{#if isPower}}<label>Nível<input type="number" data-purchase-level min="1" max="{{maxLevel}}" value="{{level}}"></label>{{/if}}{{#if options}}<select data-purchase-choice><option value="">Escolher…</option>{{#each options}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>{{/if}}</div>{{#if reason}}<small>{{reason}}</small>{{/if}}<details data-view-key="description|{{id}}"><summary>Descrição</summary><div class="npc-generator-description" data-lazy-description="{{id}}"></div></details></article>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
  <details class="npc-build-additional" data-view-key="additional-purchases"><summary>Outros poderes e aptidões</summary><input data-search value="{{search}}" placeholder="Pesquisar compras…" aria-label="Pesquisar poderes e aptidões"><div class="npc-build-purchases">{{#each purchases}}<article data-purchase="{{id}}" data-search-name="{{name}}"><div class="npc-build-purchase-line"><label><input type="checkbox" data-purchase-check {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}><strong>{{name}}</strong></label>{{#if isPower}}<label>Nível<input type="number" data-purchase-level min="1" max="{{maxLevel}}" value="{{level}}"></label>{{/if}}{{#if options}}<select data-purchase-choice><option value="">Escolher…</option>{{#each options}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>{{/if}}</div></article>{{/each}}</div></details>
  <label>Arma<select data-field="weapon">{{#each weapons}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
  {{#if isPuppeteer}}<details class="npc-special-options" data-view-key="puppet-construction" open><summary>Construção da marionete</summary><div class="npc-generator-options"><label>Tamanho<select data-field="puppetSize">{{#each puppetSizes}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Quantidade<input type="number" data-field="puppetCount" min="1" max="4" value="{{draft.puppetCount}}"></label><label>Modelo<select data-field="puppetPreset">{{#each puppetPresets}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label></div>{{#if customPuppet}}<div class="npc-puppet-devices">{{#each devices}}<label data-device="{{slug}}"><span><input type="checkbox" data-device-check {{#if checked}}checked{{/if}}> {{name}}</span><select data-device-slot aria-label="Encaixe de {{name}}">{{#each slots}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}{{#if preview.puppet}}<p class="npc-puppet-summary"><strong>{{preview.puppet.size}} · {{preview.puppet.count}} marionete(s) · {{preview.puppet.price}} Ryō</strong><span>Absorção {{preview.puppet.absorption}} · Dureza {{preview.puppet.hardness}} · Movimento {{preview.puppet.movement}} m</span><span>Controle {{preview.puppet.controlRange}} m · Ataques {{preview.puppet.attackRange}} m</span></p>{{/if}}<small>O preço é referência de construção; a criação do NPC não debita Ryō. Os dispositivos aparecem como técnicas na ficha do marionetista.</small></details>{{/if}}
  <details class="npc-build-encounter" data-view-key="encounter"><summary>Montar encontro</summary><div class="npc-generator-options"><label>NC do grupo<input type="number" data-field="partyNC" min="4" max="20" value="{{draft.partyNC}}"></label><label>Jogadores<input type="number" data-field="players" min="1" max="20" value="{{draft.players}}"></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-field="partyArea" {{#if draft.partyArea}}checked{{/if}}> Grupo com ataques em área</label></div><p>{{encounter.capangas.min}}–{{encounter.capangas.max}} capangas abaixo do NC do grupo; chefe NC {{encounter.boss.nc}}{{#unless encounter.boss.supported}} (acima do limite do gerador){{/unless}}.</p><table><caption>Referência por número de jogadores</caption><thead><tr><th>PJs</th><th>Capangas</th><th>NC do chefe</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each table.rows}}<tr><td>{{players}}</td><td>{{capangas.min}}–{{capangas.max}}</td><td>{{boss.nc}}{{#unless boss.supported}} *{{/unless}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table><small>Sugestões do {{encounter.source}}. Estas opções não alteram a ficha. * Acima de NC20.</small></details>
 </main>
 <footer class="npc-generator-footer"><button type="button" data-action="cancel">Cancelar</button><button type="button" class="npc-generator-create" data-action="create" {{#unless canCreate}}disabled{{/unless}}><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> {{#if isBusy}}Criando…{{else}}Criar NPC{{/if}}</button></footer>
</div>
